# ── Executable test case (.test/) ──
# .test/ ships a small SYNTHETIC dataset generated by .test/make_testdata.py
# (one Xenium-like and two Visium-like sections, ~1 MB), so
# `snakemake -d .test` runs the workflow end to end and .test/assert_outputs.py
# can check the numbers. Force-track the fixture files whose extensions are
# ignored above...
!.test/
!.test/**
# ...but never the artifacts a run produces.
.test/results/
.test/logs/
.test/report.zip
.test/run.log
.test/.snakemake/
.test/__pycache__/
